OL,3,GNEWSAHikers warned not to get caught
OL,4,Aout by clock change
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mountain rescue team has warned
OL,7,Fwalkers against being caught out by the
OL,8,Fdarkness this weekend with the clocks
OL,9,Fchanging.
OL,11,FPatterdale Mountain Rescue Team's
OL,12,Fleader Matt Cox said the volunteers had
OL,13,Fbeen called out to rescue an individual
OL,14,Ffrom Helvellyn at 18:30 BST on
OL,15,FWednesday after it got too dark for
OL,16,Fthem to walk down.
OL,18,FCox said he could guarantee more people
OL,19,Fwould also need rescuing for the same
OL,20,Freason across the Lake District this
OL,21,Fweekend and next.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
